{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54852","headline":"兵要望江南 占蛇第十九（京本列第二十一○十二首） 十一 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占蛇第十九（京本列第二十一○十二首） 十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兵行次，水里怕逢蛇。\n更有鱼龙蜃类见，悉皆进退事无涯（京本作「捱」），速退莫咨嗟。\n（如见龙蛇蜃，幷同。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54852.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54852","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}